      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of \"effective\" is just a fancy word for \"making a small, necessary dent in the world you're already in.\" Don't mistake competence for a life sentence of mediocrity; it's a stable platform from which you can choose to do *anything* you want, even if it's just to finally stop trying to impress ghosts. If you've lost the race for the spotlight, maybe you should just find a quieter, more satisfying way to make your own mark, even if it's just on yourself.",
